      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-give-context-10-4436b64f-b9e2-4bbc-bfbd-5bb0738dd413",
        "text": "But when I tried again with more details, the AI gave me a useful reply!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9c5dcd07c30b0675c07d039c4bc51616-adaptive-HoAI26-give-context-10-panel-2-9543f87e-b3c9-45fc-82e2-10fbd113227a.png",
