      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-give-context-10-b6791e81-fea9-4823-8167-2435ed557756",
        "text": "Good bug reports answer three questions: What did you expect? What happened? And where?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e9799e472ee00a3229646b00aa007435-adaptive-HoAI26-give-context-10-panel-3-9dcf37e3-41a9-4ba6-b13c-c793013368d9.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "A comedy sketch where a student learns the importance of detailed bug reports. See how vague reports yield unhelpful replies, while clear reports lead to useful solutions. Understand the three key questions for reporting issues."
